// Lampemodeller: navn, kort tekst, fakta med kilde og søgemønster mod titel/beskrivelse. Fakta er hentet fra Louis Poulsen, museer og lex.dk.
const MODELS = [
  {"id":"system","name":"PH-treskærmssystemet (System PH)","name_en":"The PH three-shade system (System PH)","year":"1924–26","text":"Tre skærme formet så pæren er skjult fra normale synsvinkler, og lyset kastes blødt ned og ud. Vandt guldmedalje i Paris 1925 og blev patenteret i over ti lande.","text_en":"Three shades shaped so the bulb is hidden from normal viewing angles, and the light is cast softly down and out. Won a gold medal in Paris in 1925 and was patented in more than ten countries.","how":"Flere koncentriske, krumme skærme omslutter pæren delvist, så man ikke ser lyskilden direkte, og kaster lyset nedad som diffust, reflekteret lys. Skærmenes form bygger på den logaritmiske spiral med lyskilden i spiralens centrum, så lyset fordeles jævnt over skærmens krumning, og hver skærm reducerer lyset lige meget. Målet var at fjerne blænding og bløde skyggerne op fra den elektriske glødepære.","how_en":"Several concentric, curved shades partly enclose the bulb, so you do not see the light source directly, and cast the light downwards as diffuse, reflected light. The shape of the shades is based on the logarithmic spiral with the light source at the centre of the spiral, so the light is spread evenly over the curve of the shade, and each shade reduces the light by the same amount. The aim was to remove glare and soften the shadows from the electric incandescent bulb.","variants":"Første lamper til Paris 1925 og Forum 1926 (overskærme op til 85 cm); kobberprototype 1926 (Designmuseum Danmark); patent DK-prioritet 1925 / US 1930; ca. 1000 modeller i alt; Centenary Edition-serie 2025-26.","variants_en":"First lamps for Paris 1925 and Forum 1926 (top shades up to 85 cm); copper prototype 1926 (Designmuseum Danmark); patent with Danish priority 1925 / US 1930; about 1000 models in total; Centenary Edition series 2025-26.","dating":"1924–26 (samarbejde fra 1924, Paris 1925, Forum 1926). Louis Poulsen angiver skiftevis 1925, 1925-26 og 1926 for selve systemet; Cooper Hewitt nævner prototyper i en Louis Poulsen-konkurrence i 1924.","dating_en":"1924–26 (collaboration from 1924, Paris 1925, Forum 1926). Louis Poulsen variously gives 1925, 1925-26 and 1926 for the system itself; Cooper Hewitt mentions prototypes in a Louis Poulsen competition in 1924.","facts":[{"text":"PH indledte i 1924 et samarbejde med Sophus Kaastrup-Olsen fra Louis Poulsen.","text_en":"In 1924 PH began a collaboration with Sophus Kaastrup-Olsen of Louis Poulsen.","url":"https://lex.dk/PH-lampe"},{"text":"Ved verdensudstillingen i Paris i 1925 vandt PH guldmedalje for sin modulopbyggede flerskærmslampe.","text_en":"At the world exhibition in Paris in 1925, PH won a gold medal for his modular multi-shade lamp.","url":"https://lex.dk/PH-lampe"},{"text":"Ifølge Dansk Biografisk Leksikon vandt han guldmedalje for alle sine lampetyper ved konkurrencen i forbindelse med udstillingen i Paris 1925.","text_en":"According to Dansk Biografisk Leksikon, he won a gold medal for all his lamp types in the competition held in connection with the Paris exhibition of 1925.","url":"https://biografiskleksikon.lex.dk/Poul_Henningsen"},{"text":"Louis Poulsen kalder den første lampe med flerskærmssystemet 'Paris-lampen' og oplyser, at den vandt guld.","text_en":"Louis Poulsen calls the first lamp with the multi-shade system 'the Paris lamp' and states that it won gold.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-32-table"},{"text":"I 1926 blev en af PH's lamper valgt til belysningen af koncert- og udstillingsbygningen Forum i København.","text_en":"In 1926 one of PH's lamps was chosen to light the Forum concert and exhibition building in Copenhagen.","url":"https://lex.dk/PH-lampe"},{"text":"Louis Poulsen skriver, at de første PH-lamper debuterede ved Forum-udstillingen i København i 1926, nogle med en overskærm på 85 cm i diameter.","text_en":"Louis Poulsen writes that the first PH lamps debuted at the Forum exhibition in Copenhagen in 1926, some with a top shade 85 cm in diameter.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/guides-inspiration/ph-number-history"},{"text":"Kulturværdiudvalget erhvervede i 2024 en 'Forum-lampe' fra 1926, en af de første treskærmslamper, fra Louis Poulsens lager og overdrog den til Designmuseum Danmark.","text_en":"In 2024 the Danish Cultural Heritage Committee (Kulturværdiudvalget) acquired a 'Forum lamp' from 1926, one of the first three-shade lamps, from Louis Poulsen's stock and handed it over to Designmuseum Danmark.","url":"https://kulturvaerdier.kb.dk/2024-to-lamper-designet-af-poul-henningsen-1926-og-1958/"},{"text":"Designmuseum Danmark ejer en tidlig prototype fra 1926 med tre kobberskærme og justerbar fatning, som lagde grunden til hele familien af treskærms PH-lamper.","text_en":"Designmuseum Danmark owns an early prototype from 1926 with three copper shades and an adjustable socket, which laid the foundation for the whole family of three-shade PH lamps.","url":"https://designmuseum.dk/en/pop-up-exhibition-new-additions-to-the-collection/"},{"text":"Designmuseum Danmark (dengang Kunstindustrimuseet) blev i 1926 Danmarks første elektrisk oplyste museum med en PH-lampe af typen 5/5.","text_en":"In 1926 Designmuseum Danmark (then Kunstindustrimuseet) became Denmark's first electrically lit museum, with a PH lamp of the 5/5 type.","url":"https://designmuseum.dk/en/directors-choice/"},{"text":"PH's patent 'Reflector for Incandescent Lamps' har dansk prioritet fra 4. december 1925, blev indleveret i USA 13. november 1926 og udstedt som US 1.757.527 den 6. maj 1930 med Louis Poulsen & Co. som patenthaver.","text_en":"PH's patent 'Reflector for Incandescent Lamps' has Danish priority from 4 December 1925, was filed in the USA on 13 November 1926 and was issued as US 1,757,527 on 6 May 1930 with Louis Poulsen & Co. as patent holder.","url":"https://patents.google.com/patent/US1757527A"},{"text":"Patentet beskriver flere koncentriske, nedadtil hule skærme placeret over og under lyskildens plan.","text_en":"The patent describes several concentric shades, hollow on the underside, placed above and below the plane of the light source.","url":"https://patents.google.com/patent/US1757527A"},{"text":"Cooper Hewitt oplyser, at PH-lampen blev patenteret i maj 1928, og at tidlige eksemplarer bærer stemplet 'PAT. APPL.'.","text_en":"Cooper Hewitt states that the PH lamp was patented in May 1928 and that early examples bear the stamp 'PAT. APPL.'.","url":"https://www.cooperhewitt.org/2019/05/24/a-new-form-for-a-new-technology/"},{"text":"Treskærmssystemet bygger på den logaritmiske spiral, og hver skærm reducerer lyset lige meget på grund af dens afstand fra lyskilden.","text_en":"The three-shade system is based on the logarithmic spiral, and each shade reduces the light by the same amount because of its distance from the light source.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/gulvlamper/ph-3-2-floor"},{"text":"Der er gennem årene fremstillet omkring tusind forskellige modeller i systemet som pendler, bord-, gulv- og væglamper samt lysekroner.","text_en":"Over the years about a thousand different models have been made in the system, as pendants, table, floor and wall lamps, and chandeliers.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-4-4-glass-pendant"},{"text":"De første modeller var af metal med malede indersider i fx hvid, guld eller sølv, alt efter om man ønskede diffust, varmt eller koldt lys; senere kom glasskærme.","text_en":"The first models were made of metal with the insides painted, for example, white, gold or silver, depending on whether diffuse, warm or cold light was wanted; glass shades came later.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-4-4-glass-pendant"},{"text":"PH's skærmsystem er optaget i Kulturkanonen.","text_en":"PH's shade system is included in the Danish Culture Canon (Kulturkanonen).","url":"https://lex.dk/PH-lampe"},{"text":"Dansk Biografisk Leksikon kalder den blændfri PH-lampe Danmarks første originale stykke industrikunst og en stor kommerciel succes.","text_en":"Dansk Biografisk Leksikon calls the glare-free PH lamp Denmark's first original piece of industrial art and a great commercial success.","url":"https://biografiskleksikon.lex.dk/Poul_Henningsen"}],"re":/system ph|treskærm|three-shade|tre skærme|reflekt|reflector|réflecteur|skærmhold|shade.holder|schirmhalter|porta|abat-jour|multiple-shade|flerskærm|katalog b|saa enkel|1931-32|\b(paris[\s-]?lamp(en|e)?|forum[\s-]?lamp(en|e)?|system[\s-]?ph|ph[\s-]?(lamp(en|e)?[\s-]?)?prototyp\w*|(tre|3)[\s-]?skærms?[\s-]?system(et)?|three[\s-]shade[\s-]system|drei[\s-]?schirm[\s-]?system|système (à|a) trois abat[\s-]jours?|treskärmssystem)\b/i},
  {"id":"ph44","name":"PH 4/4, PH 4/3, PH 5/5 og de tidlige pendler","name_en":"PH 4/4, PH 4/3, PH 5/5 and the early pendants","year":"1926–29","text":"De første serielamper. Første tal er overskærmens diameter i decimeter, andet tal er størrelsen på mellem- og underskærm. PH 4/4 med hejsetræk står på MoMA.","text_en":"The first series-produced lamps. The first number is the top shade's diameter in decimetres, the second is the size of the middle and bottom shades. A PH 4/4 with a pulley is in MoMA's collection.","how":"Tallene angiver skærmstørrelserne: første tal er overskærmens diameter i decimeter, andet tal størrelsen på mellem- og underskærm, som altid følges ad og er lånt fra en 'hel' model. I 'hele' modeller som 2/2, 4/4 og 5/5 passer de tre skærme inde i en cirkel i forholdet ca. 3:2:1, mens 'skæve' hybridmodeller som 4/3 og 3/2 har en større overskærm, så pendlen kan hænge lavere.","how_en":"The numbers give the shade sizes: the first number is the top shade's diameter in decimetres, the second the size of the middle and bottom shades, which always go together and are borrowed from a 'whole' model. In 'whole' models such as 2/2, 4/4 and 5/5 the three shades fit inside a circle in a ratio of about 3:2:1, while 'skewed' hybrid models such as 4/3 and 3/2 have a larger top shade, so the pendant can hang lower.","variants":"PH 4/4 (1926–28, messing/kobber); PH Glaspendel (1926); PH 4/3 i glas ca. 1928 og metal 1966 (pendel og bord); PH 5/5 'hel' pendel med ca. 50 cm overskærm; guldbelagte indersider på ældre metalpendler.","variants_en":"PH 4/4 (1926–28, brass/copper); PH Glass Pendant (1926); PH 4/3 in glass c. 1928 and metal 1966 (pendant and table); PH 5/5 'whole' pendant with a top shade of about 50 cm; gold-plated insides on older metal pendants.","dating":"PH 4/4 'Pulley': 1926–28 (MoMA). PH 4/3: ca. 1928 i glas og 1966 i metal (lex.dk); Louis Poulsen: metalpendel lanceret 1966 som forenkling af en lampe fra 1929. PH Glaspendel: 1926 (lex.dk).","dating_en":"PH 4/4 'Pulley': 1926–28 (MoMA). PH 4/3: c. 1928 in glass and 1966 in metal (lex.dk); Louis Poulsen: metal pendant launched in 1966 as a simplification of a lamp from 1929. PH Glass Pendant: 1926 (lex.dk).","facts":[{"text":"Første tal i PH-modelnummeret angiver overskærmens diameter i decimeter (fx 3 = 30 cm), og andet tal angiver størrelsen på mellem- og underskærmen.","text_en":"The first number in the PH model number gives the top shade's diameter in decimetres (e.g. 3 = 30 cm), and the second number gives the size of the middle and bottom shades.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/guides-inspiration/ph-number-history"},{"text":"De to nederste skærme følges altid ad og stammer fra overskærmen i en tilsvarende 'hel' model, og springet er sjældent mere end to trin, så en PH 8/5 findes ikke, mens en PH 8/6 gør.","text_en":"The two lower shades always go together and come from the top shade of a corresponding 'whole' model, and the step is rarely more than two sizes, so a PH 8/5 does not exist, while a PH 8/6 does.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/guides-inspiration/ph-number-history"},{"text":"I de 'hele' modeller passer alle tre skærme inde i en cirkel, så hver skærms største diameter rører cirklens periferi, og proportionerne er ca. 3:2:1.","text_en":"In the 'whole' models all three shades fit inside a circle, so that each shade's largest diameter touches the circumference of the circle, and the proportions are about 3:2:1.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-22-the-question-mark"},{"text":"PH 5/5 er en pendel i 'fuld' størrelse med en overskærm på ca. 50 cm og skærme i forholdet 3:2:1, beregnet til at hænge højt.","text_en":"PH 5/5 is a 'full' size pendant with a top shade of about 50 cm and shades in the ratio 3:2:1, intended to hang high.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-55-pendant2"},{"text":"De såkaldt skæve hybridmodeller blev indført, fordi man ønskede at hænge pendlerne lavere.","text_en":"The so-called skewed hybrid models were introduced because people wanted to hang the pendants lower.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-32-pendant"},{"text":"MoMA ejer en PH 4/4 'Pulley'-loftlampe dateret 1926–1928 i messing og kobber, 99,7 × 39,7 cm.","text_en":"MoMA owns a PH 4/4 'Pulley' ceiling lamp dated 1926–1928 in brass and copper, 99.7 × 39.7 cm.","url":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/488169"},{"text":"lex.dk nævner PH Glaspendel (1926) og PH 4/3 (ca. 1928 i glas, 1966 i metal) blandt PH's klassikere.","text_en":"lex.dk lists the PH Glass Pendant (1926) and PH 4/3 (c. 1928 in glass, 1966 in metal) among PH's classics.","url":"https://lex.dk/PH-lampe"},{"text":"Designmuseum Danmark omtaler en PH-glaspendel med tre glasskærme som designet i 1926.","text_en":"Designmuseum Danmark describes a PH glass pendant with three glass shades as designed in 1926.","url":"https://designmuseum.dk/udstilling/emils-ph-lampe/"},{"text":"PH 4/3 metalpendlen blev lanceret i 1966 og er en forenklet udgave af den lampe, PH tegnede i 1929, som fik højeste udmærkelse ved verdensudstillingen i Barcelona.","text_en":"The PH 4/3 metal pendant was launched in 1966 and is a simplified version of the lamp PH designed in 1929, which received the highest award at the world exhibition in Barcelona.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-43-pendant"},{"text":"For at opnå et varmere lys blev der en overgang fremstillet metalpendler med guldbelagt inderside.","text_en":"To achieve a warmer light, metal pendants with a gold-plated inside were made for a period.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-43-pendant"},{"text":"PH 4/3 har i dag skærme af spundet aluminium, hvidlakeret, og er bygget om den logaritmiske spiral med lyskildens brændpunkt i spiralens centrum.","text_en":"Today PH 4/3 has shades of spun aluminium, white lacquered, and is built around the logarithmic spiral with the focal point of the light source at the centre of the spiral.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-43-pendant"},{"text":"PH 4/3 bordlampen blev introduceret i sin nuværende form i 1966 og har en overskærm på ca. 40 cm med underskærme fra 3/3-modellen.","text_en":"The PH 4/3 table lamp was introduced in its current form in 1966 and has a top shade of about 40 cm with bottom shades from the 3/3 model.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/table/ph-43-table"}],"re":/4\/4|4\/3|pulley|forum|\bph[\s-]?(4\s?[\/\-–]\s?[34]|5\s?[\/\-–]\s?5)(?![\d½,.])|\bglaspendel/i},
  {"id":"ph32","name":"PH 3/2","name_en":"PH 3/2","year":"1925–26","text":"En \"skæv\" hybridmodel: overskærm på ca. 30 cm med mellem- og underskærm fra PH 2/2, så den kan hænge lavt over et bord.","text_en":"A \"skewed\" hybrid model: a top shade of about 30 cm with middle and bottom shades from PH 2/2, so it can hang low over a table.","how":"PH 3/2 er en 'skæv' hybridmodel: en overskærm på ca. 30 cm kombineret med mellem- og underskærm fra 2/2-modellen. Den store overskærm kaster lyset nedad, mens de mindre underskærme gør lampen lettere og egnet til at hænge lavt over et bord.","how_en":"PH 3/2 is a 'skewed' hybrid model: a top shade of about 30 cm combined with middle and bottom shades from the 2/2 model. The large top shade casts the light downwards, while the smaller lower shades make the lamp lighter and suitable for hanging low over a table.","variants":"Pendel, bord-, væglampe; opalglas i tre lag; Centenary Edition (bordlampe i bruneret messing med amber overskærm).","variants_en":"Pendant, table and wall lamp; three-layer opal glass; Centenary Edition (table lamp in burnished brass with amber top shade).","dating":"Ingen selvstændig designdato hos kilderne; del af treskærmssystemet 1925-26.","dating_en":"No separate design date in the sources; part of the three-shade system 1925-26.","facts":[{"text":"PH 3/2 pendlen består af en overskærm på ca. 30 cm med underskærme fra den model, der hed 2/2.","text_en":"The PH 3/2 pendant consists of a top shade of about 30 cm with bottom shades from the model called 2/2.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-32-pendant"},{"text":"Hybridmodellerne blev introduceret for at kunne hænge pendlerne i lavere højde.","text_en":"The hybrid models were introduced so the pendants could hang at a lower height.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-32-pendant"},{"text":"PH 3/2 pendlen har skærme af mundblæst opalglas i tre lag, blank på oversiden og sandblæst mat på undersiden.","text_en":"The PH 3/2 pendant has shades of mouth-blown three-layer opal glass, glossy on the top and sandblasted matt on the underside.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-32-pendant"},{"text":"PH 3/2 bordlampen består af en overskærm på ca. 30 cm og underskærme fra 2/2-versionen.","text_en":"The PH 3/2 table lamp consists of a top shade of about 30 cm and bottom shades from the 2/2 version.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-32-table"},{"text":"PH 3/2 Bordlampe Centenary Edition i bruneret messing har en firelags amberfarvet overskærm og trelags hvide opalglas-underskærme.","text_en":"The PH 3/2 Table Lamp Centenary Edition in burnished brass has a four-layer amber-coloured top shade and three-layer white opal glass bottom shades.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-32-table-lamp-centenary-edition"}],"re":/\bph[\s-]?3\s?[\/\-–]\s?2(?![\d½,.])/i},
  {"id":"bord","name":"PH-bordlamper (PH 3½-2½ m.fl.)","name_en":"PH table lamps (PH 3½-2½ and others)","year":"1927–28","text":"Treskærmssystemet på fod. Den første bordlampe kom i begyndelsen af 1927, PH 3½-2½ i 1928.","text_en":"The three-shade system on a base. The first table lamp came in early 1927, PH 3½-2½ in 1928.","how":"Bordlampen overfører treskærmssystemet til en lampe på fod: overskærmen fanger lyset og sender det nedad, mens de nederste skærme af opalglas giver et blødt, blændfrit lys. På PH 3½-2½ reflekterer metaloverskærmens hvide underside lyset ned gennem to opalglasskærme, hvilket PH fandt udnyttede lyskilden bedre.","how_en":"The table lamp brings the three-shade system to a lamp on a base: the top shade catches the light and sends it downwards, while the lower opal glass shades give a soft, glare-free light. On the PH 3½-2½ the white underside of the metal top shade reflects the light down through two opal glass shades, which PH found made better use of the light source.","variants":"PH 3½-2½ Bord (1928, metal- og glasoverskærm), PH 4/3 Bord (ca. 1927; nuværende form 1966), PH 3/2 og PH 2/1 Bord; PH 3½-2½ Gulv (nuværende form 2002).","variants_en":"PH 3½-2½ Table (1928, metal and glass top shade), PH 4/3 Table (c. 1927; current form 1966), PH 3/2 and PH 2/1 Table; PH 3½-2½ Floor (current form 2002).","dating":"Første PH-bordlampe færdig i begyndelsen af 1927 (Louis Poulsen); PH 3½-2½ Bord designet 1928. MoMA daterer en PH-bordlampe til 1926; V&A angiver designet 1927, fremstillet 1928.","dating_en":"First PH table lamp finished in early 1927 (Louis Poulsen); PH 3½-2½ Table designed 1928. MoMA dates a PH table lamp to 1926; the V&A gives designed 1927, made 1928.","facts":[{"text":"Den første PH-bordlampe blev lanceret i begyndelsen af 1927 som et alternativ til hængelamper.","text_en":"The first PH table lamp was launched in early 1927 as an alternative to hanging lamps.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-3-2-glass-table"},{"text":"PH 3½-2½ Bord er designet i 1928 og forsynet med den første type skærmholdere med skrueindstilling.","text_en":"PH 3½-2½ Table was designed in 1928 and fitted with the first type of shade holders with screw adjustment.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250215002605/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-3-2-table"},{"text":"På PH 3½-2½ har metaloverskærmen en omrullet kant, og de to nederste skærme er af mundblæst opalglas, hvilket ifølge PH udnyttede lyskilden bedre og gav mere nedadrettet lys.","text_en":"On the PH 3½-2½ the metal top shade has a rolled edge, and the two lower shades are made of mouth-blown opal glass, which according to PH made better use of the light source and gave more downward light.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250215002605/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-3-2-table"},{"text":"PH 3½-2½ Glas Bord blev skabt i 1928 med skærme af mundblæst opalglas i tre lag med blank overside og sandblæst mat underside.","text_en":"PH 3½-2½ Glass Table was created in 1928 with shades of mouth-blown three-layer opal glass with a glossy top and sandblasted matt underside.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-3-2-glass-table"},{"text":"V&A's PH-bordlampe er dateret designet 1927 og fremstillet 1928 i forniklet messing, aluminium, hvidt opalglas og bakelit, 52 cm høj med 39,5 cm overskærm.","text_en":"The V&A's PH table lamp is dated designed 1927 and made 1928 in nickel-plated brass, aluminium, white opal glass and Bakelite, 52 cm high with a 39.5 cm top shade.","url":"https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O73130/table-lamp-hennigsen-poul/"},{"text":"Ifølge V&A fremstillede Louis Poulsen lampen fra 1928 først til Deutsche Lampengesellschaft MBH i Karlsruhe.","text_en":"According to the V&A, Louis Poulsen first made the lamp from 1928 for Deutsche Lampengesellschaft MBH in Karlsruhe.","url":"https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O73130/table-lamp-hennigsen-poul/"},{"text":"MoMA ejer en PH-bordlampe dateret 1926 i bakelit, glas og messing.","text_en":"MoMA owns a PH table lamp dated 1926 in Bakelite, glass and brass.","url":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/1627"},{"text":"Cooper Hewitt ejer en PH 4/3 bordlampe fra ca. 1927 i presset glas og patineret metal, 51,5 × 39,5 × 39,5 cm.","text_en":"Cooper Hewitt owns a PH 4/3 table lamp from c. 1927 in pressed glass and patinated metal, 51.5 × 39.5 × 39.5 cm.","url":"https://www.cooperhewitt.org/2019/05/24/a-new-form-for-a-new-technology/"},{"text":"PH 2/1 bordlampen består af en overskærm på ca. 20 cm og underskærme fra 1/1-versionen.","text_en":"The PH 2/1 table lamp consists of a top shade of about 20 cm and bottom shades from the 1/1 version.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-21-table"},{"text":"PH 3½-2½ består af en overskærm på ca. 35 cm, og gulvlampen blev introduceret i sin nuværende form i 2002.","text_en":"PH 3½-2½ consists of a top shade of about 35 cm, and the floor lamp was introduced in its current form in 2002.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/gulvlamper/ph-3-2-floor"}],"re":/table lamp|bordlampe|"ph" table|3½-2½|3-2½|2\/1|\bph[\s-]?(3½|3[,.]5|3 1\/2|4½|4[,.]5|4 1\/2)\s?[\/\-–]\s?(2½|2[,.]5|2 1\/2|3½|3[,.]5|3 1\/2)|\bph[\s-]?(bord(lampe)?|table[\s-]?lamp|tischleuchte|lampe de table|bordslampa)\b/i},
  {"id":"septima","name":"PH Septima","name_en":"PH Septima","year":"1927–31","text":"Syv glasskærme: fire ekstra skærme indsat mellem de tre basisskærme. Udgik i 1940’erne og blev genudsendt i 2020.","text_en":"Seven glass shades: four extra shades inserted between the three basic shades. Discontinued in the 1940s and reissued in 2020.","how":"Septima er treskærmssystemet med fire ekstra skærme indsat mellem de tre basisskærme, i alt syv glasskærme. Skærmene af klart glas har skiftevis klare og matterede felter, placeret så de matterede felter dækker de klare nedenunder; det spreder lyset diffust, men holder det blændfrit og nedadrettet.","how_en":"Septima is the three-shade system with four extra shades inserted between the three basic shades, seven glass shades in all. The clear glass shades have alternating clear and frosted bands, placed so the frosted bands cover the clear ones below; this spreads the light diffusely but keeps it glare-free and directed downwards.","variants":"Septima 5 (1927-31, efter PH 5/5), Septima 4 (1931, efter PH 4/4); ude af produktion 1940/1940'erne; relancering 2020 i borosilikatglas, ca. Ø 50 cm.","variants_en":"Septima 5 (1927-31, after PH 5/5), Septima 4 (1931, after PH 4/4); out of production 1940/the 1940s; relaunched 2020 in borosilicate glass, about Ø 50 cm.","dating":"1927–31 (udvikling); prototype udstillet 1928; Septima 4 lanceret 1931; relanceret 2020.","dating_en":"1927–31 (development); prototype exhibited 1928; Septima 4 launched 1931; relaunched 2020.","facts":[{"text":"PH Septima blev første gang udstillet som prototype på Det danske Kunstindustrimuseum (nu Designmuseum Danmark) i 1928 og fik stor ros.","text_en":"PH Septima was first exhibited as a prototype at the Danish Museum of Art and Design (now Designmuseum Danmark) in 1928 and was highly praised.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-septima"},{"text":"Septima har fire ekstra skærme indsat mellem treskærmssystemets tre basisskærme, i alt syv skærme.","text_en":"Septima has four extra shades inserted between the three basic shades of the three-shade system, seven shades in all.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-septima"},{"text":"Louis Poulsen daterer udviklingen af Septima til 1927-31.","text_en":"Louis Poulsen dates the development of Septima to 1927-31.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-artichoke-glass"},{"text":"I 1931 blev en mindre PH Septima 4 lanceret, baseret på skærmstørrelserne fra PH 4/4, mens den oprindelige Septima 5 bygger på PH 5/5.","text_en":"In 1931 a smaller PH Septima 4 was launched, based on the shade sizes of PH 4/4, while the original Septima 5 is based on PH 5/5.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-septima"},{"text":"Henningsen tegnede også en metalversion af Septima, som aldrig kom i produktion, men tegningerne dannede grundlag for PH Artichoke.","text_en":"Henningsen also designed a metal version of Septima, which never went into production, but the drawings formed the basis for PH Artichoke.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-septima"},{"text":"Septima gik ud af produktion i 1940'erne på grund af råvaremangel; et andet Louis Poulsen-afsnit angiver præcist 1940.","text_en":"Septima went out of production in the 1940s because of a shortage of raw materials; another Louis Poulsen page gives 1940 exactly.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-septima"},{"text":"Louis Poulsen relancerede Septima i 2020 baseret på Septima 5 med optimeret ophæng og skærme af italiensk borosilikatglas.","text_en":"Louis Poulsen relaunched Septima in 2020 based on Septima 5, with an improved suspension and shades of Italian borosilicate glass.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-septima"}],"re":/septima|septima/i},
  {"id":"qm","name":"PH 2/2 Spørgsmålstegnet","name_en":"PH 2/2 The Question Mark","year":"1931","text":"Bord- og væglampe på en buet stander formet som et spørgsmålstegn. Produceret til midten af 1950’erne, genudsendt som limited edition i 2021.","text_en":"Table and wall lamp on a curved stem shaped like a question mark. Produced until the mid-1950s, reissued as a limited edition in 2021.","how":"Bordlampen bygger på treskærmssystemet og kombinerer blændfrit nedadrettet lys med en opadrettet glød. Lampehovedet sidder på en krum stander, og lysets retning kan justeres ved at dreje håndtaget midt på standeren.","how_en":"The table lamp is based on the three-shade system and combines glare-free downward light with an upward glow. The lamp head sits on a curved stem, and the direction of the light can be adjusted by turning the handle in the middle of the stem.","variants":"Original 1931 til midten af 1950'erne (messing, farvede glasskærme inkl. rav); Limited Edition 2021 (børstet messing, opalglas); senere krom- og Pale Rose-udgaver.","variants_en":"Original 1931 to the mid-1950s (brass, coloured glass shades including amber); Limited Edition 2021 (brushed brass, opal glass); later chrome and Pale Rose versions.","dating":"1931","dating_en":"1931","facts":[{"text":"PH designede den originale PH 2/2 bordlampe i 1931 på basis af sit treskærmssystem fra 1926.","text_en":"PH designed the original PH 2/2 table lamp in 1931, based on his three-shade system from 1926.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-22-the-question-mark"},{"text":"Lampen fik navnet 'Spørgsmålstegnet' på grund af standerens krumning.","text_en":"The lamp got the name 'the Question Mark' because of the curve of the stem.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-22-the-question-mark"},{"text":"PH 2/2 Spørgsmålstegnet blev produceret indtil midten af 1950'erne i messing med glasskærme i forskellige farver, herunder rav.","text_en":"PH 2/2 The Question Mark was produced until the mid-1950s in brass with glass shades in various colours, including amber.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/bordlamper/ph-22-the-question-mark"},{"text":"I 'hele' modeller som 2/2 måler overskærmen ca. 20 cm.","text_en":"In 'whole' models such as 2/2 the top shade measures about 20 cm.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/press/ph-22-question-mark-limited-edition"},{"text":"I efteråret 2021 kom en limited edition i børstet messing med mundblæste trelags opalglasskærme, hvis hoved kan vippes 45 grader til hver side; den var i butikkerne 1. oktober–31. december 2021.","text_en":"In autumn 2021 a limited edition came out in brushed brass with mouth-blown three-layer opal glass shades, whose head can be tilted 45 degrees to each side; it was in shops from 1 October to 31 December 2021.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/press/ph-22-question-mark-limited-edition"}],"re":/question mark|spørgsmålstegn|2\/2|spørgsmålstegn(et)?|question[\s-]?mark|fragezeichen|point d.interrogation|frågetecken|hatena|\bph[\s-]?2\s?[\/\-–]\s?2(?![\d½,.])/i},
  {"id":"ph5","name":"PH 5","name_en":"PH 5","year":"1958","text":"Designet så den virker med enhver pære. Den lille røde kegle og den blå reflektor inderst korrigerer lysets farve. Louis Poulsens mest solgte lampe.","text_en":"Designed to work with any bulb. The small red cone and the blue reflector at the centre correct the colour of the light. Louis Poulsen's best-selling lamp.","how":"PH 5 blev skabt, så enhver glødepære kunne bruges uden blænding, uanset pærens form og størrelse. Det pyramidelignende armatur sender både nedadrettet og sideværts lys, som også oplyser selve lampen indefra, og lyset er blødt og helt blændfrit. Oprindelig havde lampen røde og blå elementer for at forbedre lysets farve.","how_en":"PH 5 was created so that any incandescent bulb could be used without glare, whatever the bulb's shape and size. The pyramid-like fitting sends light both downwards and sideways, which also lights up the lamp itself from within, and the light is soft and completely glare-free. Originally the lamp had red and blue elements to improve the colour of the light.","variants":"PH 5 Ø 50 cm (1958); PH 5 Mini Ø ca. 30 cm (2017); otte farver 2018; Mini Monokrom 2020; PH 5 Opal; Anniversary 2024 (hvid/rosa).","variants_en":"PH 5 Ø 50 cm (1958); PH 5 Mini Ø about 30 cm (2017); eight colours 2018; Mini Monochrome 2020; PH 5 Opal; Anniversary 2024 (white/rose).","dating":"1958 (Louis Poulsen, lex.dk/PH-lampe, MoMA); lex.dk-artiklen om Poul Henningsen angiver 1956.","dating_en":"1958 (Louis Poulsen, lex.dk/PH-lampe, MoMA); the lex.dk article on Poul Henningsen gives 1956.","facts":[{"text":"Poul Henningsen skabte PH 5 i 1958 som modreaktion på glødepærernes konstante ændringer i form og størrelse, så enhver pære kunne bruges.","text_en":"Poul Henningsen created PH 5 in 1958 as a response to the constant changes in the shape and size of incandescent bulbs, so that any bulb could be used.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5"},{"text":"Tallet 5 henviser til hovedskærmens diameter på 50 cm.","text_en":"The number 5 refers to the main shade's diameter of 50 cm.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en/shop-by/collection/ph-5"},{"text":"PH 5 sender både nedadrettet og sideværts lys, som oplyser selve armaturet.","text_en":"PH 5 sends light both downwards and sideways, which lights up the fitting itself.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5"},{"text":"PH 5 havde oprindelig røde og blå skærme for at forbedre lysets farve; de er fjernet i senere udgaver.","text_en":"PH 5 originally had red and blue shades to improve the colour of the light; they have been removed in later versions.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-anniversary"},{"text":"Om PH 5 sagde Henningsen: 'With the new PH 5, I surrender to the light bulb manufacturers.'","text_en":"About PH 5 Henningsen said: 'With the new PH 5, I surrender to the light bulb manufacturers.'","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en/press/ph-5"},{"text":"PH 5 Mini med en overskærm på ca. 30 cm blev introduceret i 2017.","text_en":"PH 5 Mini, with a top shade of about 30 cm, was introduced in 2017.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-mini"},{"text":"I februar 2018 kom den originale PH 5 i de samme otte farver som PH 5 Mini i anledning af 60-årsjubilæet.","text_en":"In February 2018 the original PH 5 came out in the same eight colours as PH 5 Mini to mark its 60th anniversary.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en/press/ph-5"},{"text":"Skærmene på den nuværende PH 5 er af spundet kobber, messing eller aluminium.","text_en":"The shades of the current PH 5 are made of spun copper, brass or aluminium.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-5"},{"text":"MoMA ejer en PH 5 pendel fra 1958 i aluminium, 28,6 × 50,2 cm, givet af producenten.","text_en":"MoMA owns a PH 5 pendant from 1958 in aluminium, 28.6 × 50.2 cm, a gift from the manufacturer.","url":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/3219"},{"text":"lex.dk kalder PH 5 (lanceret 1958) den populære PH-lampe blandt hans klassikere.","text_en":"lex.dk calls PH 5 (launched 1958) the popular PH lamp among his classics.","url":"https://lex.dk/PH-lampe"},{"text":"Louis Poulsen udsendte en jubilæumsudgave af PH 5, som kun kunne købes i 2024, mat hvid udvendig med lys rosa inderside.","text_en":"Louis Poulsen released an anniversary edition of PH 5 that could only be bought in 2024, matt white outside with a light rose inside.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-anniversary"}],"re":/ph[ -]?5(?![\/\d])|ph5|\bph[\s-]?5(?![\d½,.]|\s?[\/\-–]\s?\d)/i},
  {"id":"kogle","name":"PH Kogle (PH Artichoke)","name_en":"PH Artichoke (PH Kogle)","year":"1958","text":"Lavet til Langeliniepavillonen i København. 72 blade i 12 kranse skjuler pæren helt og kaster lyset tilbage i rummet.","text_en":"Made for the Langelinie Pavilion in Copenhagen. 72 leaves in 12 rings hide the bulb completely and cast the light back into the room.","how":"72 blade sidder i 12 rækker med seks blade, placeret så man ikke kan se lyskilden fra nogen vinkel. Lyset reflekteres og spredes både indad og udad af bladene, så lampen lyser sig selv op og kaster et karakteristisk mønster af diffust lys.","how_en":"72 leaves sit in 12 rows of six leaves, placed so the light source cannot be seen from any angle. The light is reflected and spread both inwards and outwards by the leaves, so the lamp lights itself up and casts a characteristic pattern of diffuse light.","variants":"Original 1958 i kobber med lys rosa inderside; i dag messing, kobber, rustfrit stål og hvid, Ø ca. 48/60/72/84 cm; Glass (2008); Anniversary (300 stk.); Pale Rose.","variants_en":"Original 1958 in copper with a light rose inside; today brass, copper, stainless steel and white, Ø about 48/60/72/84 cm; Glass (2008); Anniversary (300 pieces); Pale Rose.","dating":"1958 (Louis Poulsen, lex.dk/PH-lampe, kb.dk, MoMA, V&A); lex.dk-artiklen om Poul Henningsen angiver 1956. V&A's eksemplar er fremstillet 1960.","dating_en":"1958 (Louis Poulsen, lex.dk/PH-lampe, kb.dk, MoMA, V&A); the lex.dk article on Poul Henningsen gives 1956. The V&A's example was made in 1960.","facts":[{"text":"PH Kogle blev designet i 1958 til Eva og Niels Koppels Langeliniepavillon i København.","text_en":"PH Artichoke was designed in 1958 for Eva and Niels Koppel's Langelinie Pavilion in Copenhagen.","url":"https://kulturvaerdier.kb.dk/2024-to-lamper-designet-af-poul-henningsen-1926-og-1958/"},{"text":"Lampen har 72 metalblade i 12 rækker med seks blade, som giver blændfrit lys fra enhver vinkel.","text_en":"The lamp has 72 metal leaves in 12 rows of six leaves, which give glare-free light from any angle.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-artichoke"},{"text":"Henningsen færdiggjorde PH Artichoke på tre måneder, fordi den byggede på idéen bag PH Septima.","text_en":"Henningsen completed PH Artichoke in three months because it was based on the idea behind PH Septima.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-artichoke"},{"text":"Lampen hænger stadig i Langelinie Pavillonen.","text_en":"The lamp still hangs in the Langelinie Pavilion.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-artichoke"},{"text":"Den originale PH Artichoke var af kobber med en lys rosa inderside.","text_en":"The original PH Artichoke was made of copper with a light rose inside.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-artichoke-anniversary"},{"text":"I dag fås bladene i laserskåret messing, kobber eller rustfrit stål, og lampen fås i størrelserne 18,9, 23,6, 28,3 og 33,1 tommer (ca. 48–84 cm).","text_en":"Today the leaves come in laser-cut brass, copper or stainless steel, and the lamp comes in sizes 18.9, 23.6, 28.3 and 33.1 inches (about 48–84 cm).","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-artichoke"},{"text":"PH Artichoke i glas, med håndlavede sandblæste glasblade, blev lanceret i 2008.","text_en":"PH Artichoke in glass, with handmade sandblasted glass leaves, was launched in 2008.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-artichoke-glass"},{"text":"Kulturværdiudvalget erhvervede i 2024 den første producerede Kogle fra Louis Poulsens lager og overdrog den til Designmuseum Danmark.","text_en":"In 2024 the Danish Cultural Heritage Committee (Kulturværdiudvalget) acquired the first Artichoke ever produced from Louis Poulsen's stock and handed it over to Designmuseum Danmark.","url":"https://kulturvaerdier.kb.dk/2024-to-lamper-designet-af-poul-henningsen-1926-og-1958/"},{"text":"V&A's eksemplar, et af de første, er af kobber, stål og plast, 60 cm højt og 84 cm i diameter, med et stel af krummede forkromede stålbånd.","text_en":"The V&A's example, one of the first, is made of copper, steel and plastic, 60 cm high and 84 cm in diameter, with a frame of curved chrome-plated steel strips.","url":"https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O122466/artichoke-lamp-pendant-lamp-henningsen-poul/"},{"text":"MoMA ejer en PH Artichoke fra 1958 i kobber og stål.","text_en":"MoMA owns a PH Artichoke from 1958 in copper and steel.","url":"https://www.moma.org/collection/works/3215"},{"text":"Jubilæumsudgaven i mat hvid med lys rosa inderside er begrænset til 300 nummererede pendler.","text_en":"The anniversary edition in matt white with a light rose inside is limited to 300 numbered pendants.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-artichoke-anniversary"}],"re":/kogle|kongle|artichoke|kotte|langelinie|kogle(n|lampe[n]?)?\b|artichoke|artiskok|artischocke|artichaut|kronärtskocka|a+tichou?ku|ātichōku|langelinie/i},
  {"id":"snebold","name":"PH Snebold (Snowball)","name_en":"PH Snowball (PH Snebold)","year":"1958","text":"Otte skærme på tre ribber. Vist i 1958, men først sat i produktion i 1983. På dansk hos Louis Poulsen: Kuglelamel.","text_en":"Eight shades on three ribs. Shown in 1958, but not put into production until 1983. Louis Poulsen's Danish name for it is Kuglelamel.","how":"Lampen består af 8 skærme på tre ribber, der danner en aflang sfærisk silhuet. Skærmenes matte undersider og blanke oversider reflekterer lyset, så det fordeles diffust og blændfrit rundt om armaturet.","how_en":"The lamp consists of 8 shades on three ribs, forming an elongated spherical silhouette. The matt undersides and glossy tops of the shades reflect the light so it is spread diffusely and without glare around the fitting.","variants":"1958 (udstillet), produceret fra 1983; ca. Ø 40 cm; hvid, Soft White, Dusty Green, Dusty Blue; Anniversary Edition (300 stk.).","variants_en":"1958 (exhibited), produced from 1983; about Ø 40 cm; white, Soft White, Dusty Green, Dusty Blue; Anniversary Edition (300 pieces).","dating":"1958; relanceret 1983.","dating_en":"1958; relaunched 1983.","facts":[{"text":"PH Snowball blev designet i 1958 og har en serie på 8 skærme, der danner en aflang sfærisk silhuet, og minder om PH's Contrast-lampe og PH Louvre.","text_en":"PH Snowball was designed in 1958 and has a series of 8 shades forming an elongated spherical silhouette, resembling PH's Contrast lamp and PH Louvre.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-snowball-anniversary-edition"},{"text":"Snowball blev vist på Kunstindustrimuseet i 1958 i udstillingen 'Glas, lys og farver'.","text_en":"Snowball was shown at Kunstindustrimuseet in 1958 in the exhibition 'Glas, lys og farver'.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-snowball-anniversary-edition"},{"text":"På Louis Poulsens danske side kaldes lampen 'Kuglelamel' og blev vist sammen med PH 5 i 1958, men fik ingen opmærksomhed og blev først relanceret og produceret fra 1983.","text_en":"On Louis Poulsen's Danish site the lamp is called 'Kuglelamel'; it was shown together with PH 5 in 1958 but got no attention, and was only relaunched and produced from 1983.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-snowball"},{"text":"Snowball er en mindre udgave af PH Louvre med kun otte skærme på tre ribber og mindre diameter til rum med lavere loft.","text_en":"Snowball is a smaller version of PH Louvre with only eight shades on three ribs and a smaller diameter, for rooms with lower ceilings.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/nl-be/catalog/private/hanglampen/ph-snowball"},{"text":"Skærmene er af spundet aluminium med matte undersider og blanke oversider, der fordeler det diffuse lys jævnt.","text_en":"The shades are made of spun aluminium with matt undersides and glossy tops, which spread the diffuse light evenly.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/catalog/private/pendants/ph-snowball"},{"text":"Jubilæumsudgaven er begrænset til 300 pendler med indgraveret nummer.","text_en":"The anniversary edition is limited to 300 pendants with an engraved number.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2026/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-snowball-anniversary-edition"}],"re":/snowball|snebold|snow[\s-]?ball|snebold(en)?|schneeball|boule de neige|snöboll(en)?|kuglelamel|sun[oō]b[oō]ru/i},
  {"id":"louvre","name":"PH Louvre (PH Kugle)","name_en":"PH Louvre (PH Kugle)","year":"1957","text":"Kuglelampe lavet til Skodsborg i 1957, i hvidlakeret aluminium, ca. 60 cm i diameter.","text_en":"Globe lamp made for Skodsborg in 1957, in white lacquered aluminium, about 60 cm in diameter.","how":"Det globeformede armatur består af 13 skærme på fire ben og lyser alle flader i samme vinkel, så både vægge og loft får jævnt lys. Matte undersider og blanke oversider reflekterer lyset diffust og blændfrit.","how_en":"The globe-shaped fitting consists of 13 shades on four legs and lights all surfaces at the same angle, so both walls and ceiling get even light. Matt undersides and glossy tops reflect the light diffusely and without glare.","variants":"1957 til Skodsborg; aluminium, hvid; ca. Ø 60 cm.","variants_en":"1957 for Skodsborg; aluminium, white; about Ø 60 cm.","dating":"1957","dating_en":"1957","facts":[{"text":"PH Kugle blev fremstillet til Adventistkirken i Skodsborg i 1957.","text_en":"PH Louvre was made for the Adventist Church in Skodsborg in 1957.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250211050956/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-louvre"},{"text":"Armaturet består af 13 skærme monteret på fire ben.","text_en":"The fitting consists of 13 shades mounted on four legs.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250211050956/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-louvre"},{"text":"Lampen er en forenkling af armaturet Spiralen, som Henningsen tegnede i 1942.","text_en":"The lamp is a simplification of the Spiral fitting, which Henningsen designed in 1942.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250211050956/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-louvre"},{"text":"Skærmene er af spundet aluminium, og lampen måler ca. 60 cm i bredden.","text_en":"The shades are made of spun aluminium, and the lamp measures about 60 cm across.","url":"https://www.louispoulsen.com/en-us/c/indoor-lighting/pendants/ph-louvre"}],"re":/\bph[\s-]?louvre|\bph[\s-]?kugle(?!lamel)|\bspiral(en|lampe[n]?)\b/i},
  {"id":"fireskaerm","name":"PH 4-skærmslampen (PH 5-4½ og PH 6½-6)","name_en":"The PH four-shade lamp (PH 5-4½ and PH 6½-6)","year":"1931","text":"Fireskærmssystemet fra 1931, siden brugt i store lamper som PH 6½-6 til Charlottenborg (1979) og PH 5-4½ til Aarhus Musikhus (1984).","text_en":"The four-shade system from 1931, later used in large lamps such as PH 6½-6 for Charlottenborg (1979) and PH 5-4½ for Aarhus Musikhus (1984).","how":"Fireskærmslampen blev konstrueret for at øge den mængde lys, der sendes vandret ud fra lampen, så vægge og reoler belyses bedre end med en almindelig treskærmslampe. Den var tænkt til at hænge højt som alternativ til lysekroner.","how_en":"The four-shade lamp was designed to increase the amount of light sent out horizontally from the lamp, so walls and shelves are lit better than with an ordinary three-shade lamp. It was meant to hang high as an alternative to chandeliers.","variants":"Original 1931; PH 6½-6 (1979, Charlottenborg); PH 5-4½ (1984, Aarhus Musikhus).","variants_en":"Original 1931; PH 6½-6 (1979, Charlottenborg); PH 5-4½ (1984, Aarhus Musikhus).","dating":"1931 (4-skærmssystemet); PH 6½-6 1979; PH 5-4½ 1984.","dating_en":"1931 (the four-shade system); PH 6½-6 1979; PH 5-4½ 1984.","facts":[{"text":"4-skærmssystemet blev lanceret i 1931 som et højthængende alternativ til lysekroner.","text_en":"The four-shade system was launched in 1931 as a high-hanging alternative to chandeliers.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-4--ph-6-6"},{"text":"Fireskærmslampen blev konstrueret for at øge det vandrette lys og dermed belysningen af vægge og reoler.","text_en":"The four-shade lamp was designed to increase the horizontal light and so improve the lighting of walls and shelves.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-4--ph-6-6"},{"text":"Lampen udgik af standardsortimentet i 1940'erne, men blev i 1979 re-designet af Sophus Frandsen og Ebbe Christensen til Charlottenborg i en større størrelse, PH 6½-6, med en lille blå skærm.","text_en":"The lamp was dropped from the standard range in the 1940s, but in 1979 it was redesigned by Sophus Frandsen and Ebbe Christensen for Charlottenborg in a larger size, PH 6½-6, with a small blue shade.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-4--ph-6-6"},{"text":"I 1984 blev den mindre udgave 5-4½ fremstillet til Aarhus Musikhus.","text_en":"In 1984 the smaller version 5-4½ was made for Aarhus Musikhus.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-5-4--ph-6-6"}],"re":/\bph[\s-]?(5\s?[\/\-–]\s?(4½|4[,.]5|4 1\/2)|(6½|6[,.]5|6 1\/2)\s?[\/\-–]\s?6)|\b(fire|4)[\s-]?skærms?(lampe|system)/i},
  {"id":"bombardement","name":"PH 1/1 Lysekrone (Bombardementskronen)","name_en":"PH 1/1 Chandelier (the \"Bombardment chandelier\")","year":"1933","text":"Lysekronen PH 1/1, kaldet Bombardementskronen. I kataloget fra 1933 til midten af 1960’erne, genudsendt 2025.","text_en":"The PH 1/1 chandelier, known as the \"Bombardment chandelier\". In the catalogue from 1933 to the mid-1960s, reissued in 2025.","how":"Lysekronen består af buede arme, hver med et PH 1/1-treskærmssæt, forbundet til en central kerne. Kernerne stables lodret, så alle skærmene får plads og udsender blødt, blændfrit lys.","how_en":"The chandelier consists of curved arms, each with a PH 1/1 three-shade set, connected to a central core. The cores are stacked vertically so all the shades have room and give off soft, glare-free light.","variants":"Original 1933–midten af 1960'erne; Centenary Edition med 3/6/9 arme i dusty terracotta-opalglas.","variants_en":"Original 1933 to the mid-1960s; Centenary Edition with 3/6/9 arms in dusty terracotta opal glass.","dating":"I kataloget 1933 til midten af 1960'erne; Centenary Edition 2025-26.","dating_en":"In the catalogue from 1933 to the mid-1960s; Centenary Edition 2025-26.","facts":[{"text":"PH 1/1 Lysekronen, oprindelig kaldet 'Bombardementskronen', var i Louis Poulsens katalog fra 1933 til midten af 1960'erne.","text_en":"The PH 1/1 Chandelier, originally called the 'Bombardment chandelier', was in Louis Poulsen's catalogue from 1933 to the mid-1960s.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-11-chandelier-centenary-edition"},{"text":"Lysekronen kunne laves med forskelligt antal buede arme med hver sit PH 1/1-glasskærmssæt forbundet til en central kerne.","text_en":"The chandelier could be made with different numbers of curved arms, each with its own PH 1/1 glass shade set, connected to a central core.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-11-chandelier-centenary-edition"},{"text":"Centenary Edition fås med 3, 6 og 9 arme i bruneret messing og er begrænset til 1000, 400 og 200 nummererede eksemplarer.","text_en":"The Centenary Edition comes with 3, 6 and 9 arms in burnished brass and is limited to 1000, 400 and 200 numbered pieces.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/pendler-loftlamper/ph-11-chandelier-centenary-edition"}],"re":/bombardement\w*|\bph[\s-]?1\s?[\/\-–]\s?1(?![\d½,.])/i},
  {"id":"ph80","name":"PH 80","name_en":"PH 80","year":"1974","text":"Gulvlampe fra 1974, lanceret efter PH’s død.","text_en":"Floor lamp from 1974, launched after PH's death.","how":"PH 80 bygger på treskærmssystemet og den logaritmiske spiral, men med skærme i opal akryl, der giver et diffust, blændfrit lys. Den originale model har en rød reflektor øverst, som giver et varmt lys.","how_en":"PH 80 is based on the three-shade system and the logarithmic spiral, but with shades in opal acrylic, which give a diffuse, glare-free light. The original model has a red reflector at the top, which gives a warm light.","variants":"Gulvlampe 1974; senere sort og hvid; også bord- og portable udgave.","variants_en":"Floor lamp 1974; later black and white; also table and portable versions.","dating":"1974 (efter PH's død)","dating_en":"1974 (after PH's death)","facts":[{"text":"PH 80 blev skabt i 1974 efter PH's død for at markere 80-årsdagen for hans fødsel, deraf navnet.","text_en":"PH 80 was created in 1974 after PH's death to mark the 80th anniversary of his birth, hence the name.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/gulvlamper/ph-80"},{"text":"Tallet 80 henviser ikke til overskærmens diameter, som det normalt er tilfældet for treskærmsmodellerne.","text_en":"The number 80 does not refer to the top shade's diameter, as it normally does for the three-shade models.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/gulvlamper/ph-80"},{"text":"Den originale PH 80 har en rød reflektor øverst og skærme i opal akryl; senere kom sorte og hvide udgaver med hvid topreflektor.","text_en":"The original PH 80 has a red reflector at the top and shades in opal acrylic; later came black and white versions with a white top reflector.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/gulvlamper/ph-80"}],"re":/\bph[\s-]?80\b/i},
  {"id":"phhat","name":"PH Hat","name_en":"PH Hat","year":"1961","text":"Pendel fra 1961, oprindeligt i to størrelser.","text_en":"Pendant from 1961, originally in two sizes.","how":"PH Hat er en væglampe, hvis rosafarvede inderside giver et blødt, behageligt lys. Den var bl.a. tænkt som soveværelsesbelysning.","how_en":"PH Hat is a wall lamp whose rose-coloured inside gives a soft, pleasant light. Among other things, it was meant as bedroom lighting.","variants":"Oprindelig to størrelser (1961); kun den mindre fremstilles i dag.","variants_en":"Originally two sizes (1961); only the smaller one is made today.","dating":"1961","dating_en":"1961","facts":[{"text":"PH Hat blev designet af Poul Henningsen i 1961 og oprindelig fremstillet i to størrelser.","text_en":"PH Hat was designed by Poul Henningsen in 1961 and originally made in two sizes.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250209110532/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/vaeglamper/ph-hat"},{"text":"PH ville med PH Hat bl.a. lave en lampe til soveværelsesbelysning, og den rosafarvede inderside giver et blødt lys.","text_en":"Among other things, PH wanted PH Hat to be a lamp for bedroom lighting, and the rose-coloured inside gives a soft light.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250209110532/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/vaeglamper/ph-hat"},{"text":"I dag fås kun den mindre version.","text_en":"Today only the smaller version is available.","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250209110532/https://www.louispoulsen.com/da-dk/catalog/privat/vaeglamper/ph-hat"}],"re":/\bph[\s-]?(hat|hut|chapeau)\b/i},
  {"id":"tekst","name":"PH om lys","name_en":"PH on light","year":"1924–67","text":"PH skrev og talte om lys hele livet: i Kritisk Revy, i Louis Poulsens blad NYT og i filmen \"PH lys\" fra 1964.","text_en":"PH wrote and spoke about light all his life: in Kritisk Revy, in Louis Poulsen's magazine NYT and in the film \"PH lys\" from 1964.","re":/kritisk revy|philosophy of light|philosophie|ph lys|belysningsfilosofi|lighting philosophy|glare/i}
];
